{"parse": {"title": "Infinite", "pageid": 177, "revid": 42341, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\"Infinite Mode\" is a mode where the Player defends against endless waves of enemies, with each wave progressively getting harder. \"Infinite Mode\" is only available on \"Hard Mode\". There is a leaderboard for top \"Infinite Mode\" players in the \"Leaderboard\" area. Players who are able to maintain their leaderboard position until the end of the month will receive an exclusive unit.\n</p><p>The amount of gems you get per wave varies:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Wave 1-5: none</li>\n<li>Wave 6&#160;: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">18 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">18 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li>Wave 7-15&#160;: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">3 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">3 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li>Wave 15-100: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">5 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">5 Gems</span></span></a></li></ul>\n<p>Do note that from wave 105 onwards gems are no longer rewarded for completing them, maxing at <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">497 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">497 Gems</span></span></a> . (confirmed until wave 146)\n</p><p>Daily rewards&#160;:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Wave 10: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">90 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">90 Gems</span></span></a><br /></li>\n<li>Wave 25: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">180 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">180 Gems</span></span></a><br /></li>\n<li>Wave 50: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">330 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">330 Gems</span></span></a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Rewards\">Other Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Wave 10+ (On Loss): XP <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Items</a> and XP for units.</li>\n<li>Some Infinite Modes, such as Snowy Kingdom, may also reward players with other items, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Portals\" title=\"Portals\">Portals</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeons\" title=\"Dungeons\">Dungeon Keys</a> upon completing.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bosses\">Bosses</span></h2>\n<p>Bosses from the previous acts of the story mode spawn every 10 waves\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Leaving in the middle of the infinite will reward you gems, but you will lose out on XP and XP <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Items</a>.</li>\n<li>The Daily Rewards used to be <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">10 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">10 Gems</span></span></a>, <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">25 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">25 Gems</span></span></a> and <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">50 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">50 Gems</span></span></a> respectively, but it was buffed at Update X.</li>\n<li>Walled City is the best infinite to get takedowns for worthiness, as the Massive Colossus enemy spawns in more enemies upon death, along with the enemies having little health compared to most other infinites.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023064930\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 178/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2092/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 84/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.609      1 -total\n 91.97%    4.239     10 Template:Gems\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:177-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261023064930 and revision id 42341. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Gems.png"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Other Rewards", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Infinite", "byteoffset": 754, "anchor": "Other_Rewards", "linkAnchor": "Other_Rewards"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Bosses", "number": "2", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "Infinite", "byteoffset": 979, "anchor": "Bosses", "linkAnchor": "Bosses"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Trivia", "number": "3", "index": "3", "fromtitle": "Infinite", "byteoffset": 1060, "anchor": "Trivia", "linkAnchor": "Trivia"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Infinite</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=42341&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:16:50.636323+00:00", "sha256": "0c0776c96f3b0d77fff42dd147a00168f9c54957c7ce2b182b276d6737b61e95"}}